    "title": "Joan Patricia (Matthews) Canty - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Red Lake Nation News ,\n1 hours ago March 17, 1932 ~ January 8, 2025 (age 92) Joan Patricia Canty was born in Bena, MN on March 17, 1932. She was born to Lillian Isabell Matthews. She passed away on January 9th 2025 at Tamerack Court Assisted Living Facility in Bemidji, MN where she resided with our Father up until his death on April 26, 2024. They were married to for 75 years. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
